d for more than 10 minutes, the event staff may order a restart of the game, unless one team has a significantly larger score than the other; in such cases, the event staff may use their discretion to declare the higher-scoring team as the winner of the interrupted game.\n\n**Penalties**\n•    6.2.4.1. Penalty: If staff verify such violations or receive complaints from others, staff will impose penalties on offending competitors by disqualifying them from the competition.\n\nThis is a summary of selected clauses. Ask about a specific topic for details.\nSource: local://competition_rules/competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men', hits=[{'id': 'competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men_s03_c01', 'metadata': {'source_url': 'local://competition_rules/competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men', 'category': 'competition_rules', 'title': 'Arena of Valor (RoV): 1. กำหนดการแข่งขัน', 'source_ids': ['competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men', 'competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men_s03_c01'], 'game': 'Arena of Valor (RoV)', 'intent': '', 'facets': ['aov', 'arena of valor', 'arena of valor (rov)', 'blueket games 2025', 'competition_rules', 'competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men', 'eligibility', 'format', 'rov', 'schedule', 'tournament_rules'], 'rule_id': 'canonical::competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men_s03_c01'}}, {'id': 'competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men_s08_c01', 'metadata': {'source_url': 'local://competition_rules/competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men', 'category': 'competition_rules', 'title': 'Arena of Valor (RoV): 6. การกระทำความผิดและบทลงโทษ', 'source_ids': ['competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men', 'competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men_s08_c01'], 'game': 'Arena of Valor (RoV)', 'intent': '', 'facets': ['aov', 'arena of valor', 'arena of valor (rov)', 'blueket games 2025', 'competition_rules', 'competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men', 'eligibility', 'penalty', 'rov', 'tournament_rules'], 'rule_id': 'canonical::competition_rules_rov_blueket_2025_men_s08_c01'}}, {'id': '